(7478179, 1188530, 23098, '<td valign="top">Very nice and colorful shot.</td>', 'Very nice and colorful shot.', '2016-10-12 14:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478183, 1188549, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> Fascinating.   And... perfect for the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>I do with there were footprints behind her... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There actually were no footprints behind her, as she walked on the spot walking towards the sea, stopped there and then started walking.<br/> <br/>I shot this immediately after her first step :)<br/> <br/>Thank you for commenting :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: Fascinating.   And... perfect for the challenge topic. I do with there were footprints behind her...   There actually were no footprints behind her, as she walked on the spot walking towards the sea, stopped there and then started walking. I shot this immediately after her first step :) Thank you for commenting :)', '2016-10-12 15:23:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478184, 1188549, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Had a very similar experience many challenges ago. Great shot. I also think the one with the cookie would have done really well :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/96751.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/96751.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/96751.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a> The one with the cookie was taken after the shooting, while we were having a cup of tea... and it was a totally random shot!<br/> <br/>I notice how nice it was only after importing it on my computer.<br/> <br/>Thank you for commenting :)</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Had a very similar experience many challenges ago. Great shot. I also think the one with the cookie would have done really well :)    tanguera The one with the cookie was taken after the shooting, while we were having a cup of tea... and it was a totally random shot! I notice how nice it was only after importing it on my computer. Thank you for commenting :)', '2016-10-12 15:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
