(7478231, 1188674, 103142, '<td valign="top">Definitely should have been much higher. It was an 8 from me.</td>', 'Definitely should have been much higher. It was an 8 from me.', '2016-10-12 22:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478255, 1188562, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>This is a very accomplished floral study that fully justifies its high score and placement, well done Janine. The colours are all very subtle meeting the challenge brief fully whilst the focus and DOF is absolutely perfect for those lovely crisp edges together with an inner softness that serves to emphasise the purple tinged petals really well. The composition is spot on, they dont call them hotspots for nothing! It takes a really special floral image to get me excited, this excites me...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well This is a very accomplished floral study that fully justifies its high score and placement, well done Janine. The colours are all very subtle meeting the challenge brief fully whilst the focus and DOF is absolutely perfect for those lovely crisp edges together with an inner softness that serves to emphasise the purple tinged petals really well. The composition is spot on, they dont call them hotspots for nothing! It takes a really special floral image to get me excited, this excites me...', '2016-10-13 06:46:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478256, 1188427, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Those lovely northern lights never fail to impress and appeal to all the voters here. I like your composition, the diagonal works well. I suppose in terms of the challenge brief the purples are a little on the subtle side with the green of the aurora obviously dominating. Its good to include yourself to give a sense of scale and human presence. Well di=one for your high score and placement Benedikt.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge Those lovely northern lights never fail to impress and appeal to all the voters here. I like your composition, the diagonal works well. I suppose in terms of the challenge brief the purples are a little on the subtle side with the green of the aurora obviously dominating. Its good to include yourself to give a sense of scale and human presence. Well di=one for your high score and placement Benedikt.', '2016-10-13 06:51:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478257, 1188665, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Well, its certainly purple! Your composition is good placing the spider on an appropriate hotspot but Im afraid Im one of those who dislike the processing. In a way I like it because it makes the spider less obvious and you have to search more for it but it just feels too much, a bit overdone. I supose its the sort of effect you either like or you dont. Thanks for a different and stimulating entry Susie.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge Well, its certainly purple! Your composition is good placing the spider on an appropriate hotspot but Im afraid Im one of those who dislike the processing. In a way I like it because it makes the spider less obvious and you have to search more for it but it just feels too much, a bit overdone. I supose its the sort of effect you either like or you dont. Thanks for a different and stimulating entry Susie.', '2016-10-13 06:57:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478258, 1188598, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>I like your creative approach here, it shows originality. Unlike your commenter I think your ship is in focus in the right places but perhaps the DOF is just a tad on the shallow side, having said that the sail is nicely sharp against the soft focus background so it helps define the boat more effectively. I was thinking perhaps the exposure could be a 1/3 stop less to reduce the brightness of the highlights but this would affect your boat which is nice and bright, I would say youve got it right. Thanks for such an original entry Fabio, keep up the good work.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge well I like your creative approach here, it shows originality. Unlike your commenter I think your ship is in focus in the right places but perhaps the DOF is just a tad on the shallow side, having said that the sail is nicely sharp against the soft focus background so it helps define the boat more effectively. I was thinking perhaps the exposure could be a 1/3 stop less to reduce the brightness of the highlights but this would affect your boat which is nice and bright, I would say youve got it right. Thanks for such an original entry Fabio, keep up the good work.', '2016-10-13 07:06:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478259, 1188496, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>An accomplished portrait of a lovely model, she has a very appealing look about her. The colours fill the challenge brief well. The lighting is just a tad bright on her forehead above the mask and could benefit from a little dodging to reduce its intensity, apart from that its all very appealing well done Robert.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well An accomplished portrait of a lovely model, she has a very appealing look about her. The colours fill the challenge brief well. The lighting is just a tad bright on her forehead above the mask and could benefit from a little dodging to reduce its intensity, apart from that its all very appealing well done Robert.', '2016-10-13 07:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478260, 1188597, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Well youve certainly found an appropriate subject and what a lot of them there are! I think your DOF needed to be one or the other either completely in focus front to back or prefereably those interesting shoes in front of the pumps brought into sharp focus against a sea of OOF shoes to isolate it distinctively from the others. Thanks for an interesting entry K.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well Well youve certainly found an appropriate subject and what a lot of them there are! I think your DOF needed to be one or the other either completely in focus front to back or prefereably those interesting shoes in front of the pumps brought into sharp focus against a sea of OOF shoes to isolate it distinctively from the others. Thanks for an interesting entry K.', '2016-10-13 07:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478265, 1188666, 42256, '<td valign="top">Feel bad about taking your spot, it is a beautiful shot!<br/>We have purple doors in our 1930s house and this photograph made me wonder why I never used our door as an element in this challenge. <br/></td>', 'Feel bad about taking your spot, it is a beautiful shot!We have purple doors in our 1930s house and this photograph made me wonder why I never used our door as an element in this challenge. ', '2016-10-13 10:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478267, 1188674, 61396, '<td valign="top">you and Klimt nailed it</td>', 'you and Klimt nailed it', '2016-10-13 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478297, 1188549, 163081, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue. You''re collecting them fast :)<br/>Awesome looking model.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations on the blue. You''re collecting them fast :)Awesome looking model. ', '2016-10-13 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478309, 1188665, 182284, '<td valign="top">I still like the spider. Wish I had done less to the background. Thank you so much for your critique.</td>', 'I still like the spider. Wish I had done less to the background. Thank you so much for your critique.', '2016-10-13 18:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478310, 1188452, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful iris and droplets. 9 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful iris and droplets. 9 from me.', '2016-10-13 18:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478311, 1188666, 19825, '<td valign="top">Whenever I go out an shoot a bunch of images, I am generally only interested in keeping a small handful. So, I end up deleting a large percentage. I always worry I am going to throw out a gem among the hundreds of outtakes. Sorry to hear this happened, Anita. Could have easily happened to me.</td>', 'Whenever I go out an shoot a bunch of images, I am generally only interested in keeping a small handful. So, I end up deleting a large percentage. I always worry I am going to throw out a gem among the hundreds of outtakes. Sorry to hear this happened, Anita. Could have easily happened to me.', '2016-10-13 18:49:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478315, 1188562, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Janine. Congrats on 4th.</td>', 'Beautiful, Janine. Congrats on 4th.', '2016-10-13 21:09:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478359, 1188549, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeorgesBogaert:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on the blue. You''re collecting them fast :)<br/>Awesome looking model. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Georges!<br/> <br/>Get well soon!</td>', 'Originally posted by GeorgesBogaert: Congratulations on the blue. You''re collecting them fast :)Awesome looking model.   Thank you Georges! Get well soon!', '2016-10-14 04:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
